clump keys (? or esc to close)              │ Search
                                            │   /    search
Navigate                                    │   n/N  next/previous match
  j/k    next/previous group                │ 
  enter  focus the diff pane                │ Edit
  ]/[    next/previous group from anywhere  │   x         mark hunk
  a      grouped / all hunks                │   M         move marked hunks
                                            │   R         rename group
                                            │   u/ctrl+r  undo/redo